## Chain-of-Command & Doorbell Rules
{{ROUTING_SUMMARY}}

- **Doorbell:** resolve the target's session name with `{{CORE_CMD}} whois <target_agent_id> --id-only`, then call `SendMessage` with that name as `to`.
- **Post / Reply / Search:**
  ```bash
  {{CORE_CMD}} new-thread --author {{AGENT_ID}} --visibility team --title "..." --category task --content "..."
  {{CORE_CMD}} reply <thread_id> --author {{AGENT_ID}} --content "..."
  {{CORE_CMD}} search "<query>" --as {{AGENT_ID}}
  ```
- **Never Poll:** after posting and doorbelling, end your turn. An incoming `SendMessage` wakes you.
